title: "Zazz 0.15 alpha"
description: "Zazz 0.15 alpha lets in-page navigation share a page with htmx and client routers: an opt-out for the regions they drive, Back and Forward left to whoever made the entry, and Zazz.refresh for markup they insert."
date: 2026-11-18
